              "type": "text",
              "text": "A new car with a petrol engine uses 10.0 L/100 km.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If the cost of petrol is $1.50/L then the cost ($C) of fuel to drive the car is given by ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "C = 0.15d",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", where ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "d",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " is the distance travelled.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Another car costs $2000 more to purchase but only uses 6.0 L/100 km.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The cost of diesel fuel is $1.60/L.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The cost of driving the diesel model of the car is given by ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "C = 2000 + 0.096d",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ".",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How far do you have to travel before the cost of the two models is the same? Round your answer to the nearest kilometre.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
