    "answer": {
      "short": "Approximately $37\\,037$ km.",
      "worked": "Set the costs equal.\n$$\\begin{align*}0.15d &= 2000 + 0.096d \\\\ 0.054d &= 2000 \\\\ d &= \\frac{1\\,000\\,000}{27} \\\\ d &\\approx 37\\,037\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$\nThe costs are equal after approximately $37\\,037$ km.",
